# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own key:  cp .env.example .env
# .env is gitignored (see .gitignore) and never committed -- chaos-agents reads the key only
# from the environment (chaos_agents.dotenv loads .env at startup if one exists; a real
# `export OPENAI_API_KEY=...` in your shell always wins over whatever is in the file). Never
# put a real key directly in a campaign YAML -- those are meant to be shared/committed.
#
# Needed only for the OpenAI-backed provider/adapter (campaigns/demo_openai_chat.yaml, the
# `openai` provider, the `openai_chat` adapter). Every other campaign in this project runs
# free, with no key, against Ollama or a model-free demo target.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
